  "problem": "A pending save from an unfinished initial placement can run after detach and persist an unconfirmed offset. A late callback after a synchronous flush can capture twice.",
  "behavior": "Keep one frame queue per transcript producer. Cancel unfinished same-session placement on detach. Cancellation and flush invalidate prior callbacks without consuming a replacement frame. Confirmed and outgoing-session positions still flush synchronously.",
  "batchingDecision": "Store-scoped publication batching and the bulk state action are removed after complete confirmation fails to establish a reliable gain. Its build, patch and all seventy paired rows remain preserved.",
